.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-QUERY 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-query \- Run a SPARQL query (alias of read)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu query\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-valid\-at\fR] [\fB\-\-tx\fR] [\fB\-\-fork\fR] [\fB\-\-entailment\fR] [\fB\-\-federation\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsparql\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a SPARQL query (alias of read)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-valid\-at\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Valid\-time instant to query
.TP
\fB\-\-tx\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Historical transaction to read
.TP
\fB\-\-fork\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Named store fork to query
.TP
\fB\-\-entailment\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Query entailment regime
.TP
\fB\-\-federation\fR
Enable configured remote query federation
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIsparql\fR>

